# x64-only build surface

VectorNNTPD **targets amd64/x64 only**. ARM (including ARM64) and **x86** are **out of scope** for compilation and packaging in this repository.

## Enforcement

- **`Directory.Build.props`** sets **`Platforms`** to **`x64`** and **`PlatformTarget`** to **`x64`** for all MSBuild projects inheriting repo-wide props.
- **`VectorNNTPD.Server.sln`** must expose **only** **`Debug|x64`** and **`Release|x64`** solution configurations — no **Any CPU**, **x86**, **ARM**, or **ARM64** entries.

## Agent constraints

- Do **not** add x86 or ARM solution configuration mappings, RID defaults (`win-x86`, `linux-arm64`, etc.), or multi-platform publishing matrices unless the user explicitly expands scope.
- Align runtime identifiers and deployment docs with **x64/amd64** (`.NET` terms: **`win-x64`**, **`linux-x64`** where applicable).

This complements **`architecture-and-contracts.mdc`** (product ARM/x64 narrative): builds here remain **x64-only** regardless of longer-term product scope.
